      [1;34m"body"[m[1;38m:[m [32m"## Summary\n\nMeta-epic for an **exhaustive residual CodeRabbit campaign** on BioETL, complementary to continuous PR App reviews.\n\nCodeRabbit is **not** sole SSOT (see `docs/03-guides/coderabbit-audit-playbook.md`):\n\n1. Code / contracts / config  \n2. ADRs + RULES  \n3. Architecture tests / quality gates  \n4. CodeRabbit findings (must map to evidence)\n\n**Do not increase tech-debt budgets** to silence findings.\n\n## Baseline (at epic open)\n\n- Target: `main` @ `62a8c94ecf4614250bc8e470089361fe7223e8cd` (refresh at CR-FULL-00)\n- Config: `.coderabbit.yaml` (`profile: assertive`)\n- CI CLI: `.github/workflows/coderabbit.yml`\n- Playbook: `docs/03-guides/coderabbit-audit-playbook.md`\n- Launcher: `scripts/ops/run-coderabbit-reviews.sh`\n\n## Child issues\n\n| Code | Pri | Issue | Title |\n|------|-----|------:|-------|\n| CR-FULL-00 | P0 | #7689 | Preflight: freeze baseline, tools, ground-truth gates |\n| CR-FULL-01 | P1 | #7690 | Wave A: architecture residual |\n| CR-FULL-02 | P1 | #7691 | Wave B: data plane |\n| CR-FULL-03 | P1 | #7692 | Wave C: adapters / resilience |\n| CR-FULL-04 | P1 | #7693 | Wave D: security |\n| CR-FULL-05 | P2 | #7694 | Wave E: contracts / docs / Grafana |\n| CR-FULL-06 | P2 | #7695 | Wave F: test honesty |\n| CR-FULL-07 | P1 | #7696 | Normalize FINDINGS + triage + pack |\n| CR-FULL-08 | P2 | #7697 | Closeout re-audit + FINAL.md |\n| CR-FULL-09 | P2 | #7698 | CLI secret + workflow health |\n\n### Checklist\n- [ ] #7689 Preflight  \n- [ ] #7690 Wave A  \n- [ ] #7691 Wave B  \n- [ ] #7692 Wave C  \n- [ ] #7693 Wave D  \n- [ ] #7694 Wave E  \n- [ ] #7695 Wave F  \n- [ ] #7696 FINDINGS triage  \n- [ ] #7697 Closeout  \n- [ ] #7698 Secret/workflow  \n\n## Execution order\n```text\n#7689 → (#7690 ‖ #7691 ‖ #7692 ‖ #7693 ‖ #7694 ‖ #7695 sequential CLI)\n→ #7696 → implement P0/P1 → #7697\n#7698 can run in parallel with #7689\n```\n\n## Hard constraints\n- ≤~300 files per CLI run  \n- Sequential scopes (rate limits)  \n- WSL/Linux for CLI on Windows hosts  \n- Artifacts: `reports/quality/coderabbit/`  \n- Prefer PR App continuous; CLI residual  \n\n## Acceptance (epic)\n- [ ] Waves run or skipped with reason  \n- [ ] FINDINGS.md + severity counts  \n- [ ] P0/P1 fixed or tracked  \n- [ ] Re-audit fixed scopes  \n- [ ] FINAL.md + no budget growth  \n\n## Pack\n`.github/ISSUES/CODERABBIT-FULL-2026-08-ISSUE-PACK.md`"[m[1;38m,[m
